# Catalyst One Implementation Lifecycle (Pre–Go-Live)

**Status:** PRODUCT OWNER CERTIFIED · Mandatory until official production Go-Live  
**Source:** ADR-019 Implementation Programme v1.0 (2026-07-25)

## Mandatory lifecycle (every implementation wave)

1. Architecture Approval  
2. Sprint Approval  
3. Constitutional Health Check (**GREEN**)  
4. Implementation  
5. Business Acceptance Testing (BAT)  
6. Product Owner Certification  
7. Replacement Certification (where applicable)  
8. Enterprise Health Check (**GREEN**)  
9. Freeze  

## Rules

- CHC **AMBER** or **RED** → stop · Architecture Impact Report · no production code.  
- EHC **AMBER** or **RED** → do not certify · do not Freeze.  
- Programme approval ≠ wave implementation authorisation.  
- Mandatory controls: Business Milestones · CHC · EHC · Architecture Impact Report · Replacement Certification · Freeze Gates.

